@startuml
title Story 2 — Top10 (sex + state)
actor User
participant "Browser UI" as UI
participant "app.js (Client)" as JS
participant "Rankings API\n/ api/rankings" as RankingsAPI
participant "IBGE (external)" as IBGE
User -> UI: change sex/state
UI -> JS: onChange -> loadRanking()
JS -> RankingsAPI: GET /api/rankings?sex=M&state=SP
RankingsAPI -> IBGE: (if integrated) fetch ranking
IBGE --> RankingsAPI: ranking data
RankingsAPI --> JS: 200 Top10 JSON
JS -> UI: update ranking list
@enduml
